1
00:00:56,280 --> 00:01:02,680
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:05,827 --> 00:01:07,066
Zhao Yang.

3
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:09,160
You're asking for death.

4
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:16,770
Shen Xiao!

5
00:01:21,549 --> 00:01:22,786
(Why?)

6
00:01:23,773 --> 00:01:25,800
(Your father died because of me.)

7
00:01:26,773 --> 00:01:28,506
(Yet you still tried to save me.)

8
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:32,840
You absolute fool.

9
00:01:33,293 --> 00:01:34,530
Shen Xiao.

10
00:01:35,118 --> 00:01:36,697
I thought someone from your humble background

11
00:01:36,721 --> 00:01:38,148
would know how to read the situation.

12
00:01:38,172 --> 00:01:39,409
Turns out,

13
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:41,543
you're just as thick-headed as the rest.

14
00:01:43,493 --> 00:01:44,730
Fine then.

15
00:01:44,884 --> 00:01:46,578
I can send you on your way too.

16
00:01:56,012 --> 00:01:57,249
Your Highness.

17
00:01:58,036 --> 00:01:59,956
Zhao Yang is still a princess of the Ye Dynasty.

18
00:02:00,468 --> 00:02:01,788
She deserves a quick death.

19
00:02:01,869 --> 00:02:03,106
Let her keep some dignity.

20
00:02:03,508 --> 00:02:04,803
Dignity?

21
00:02:06,989 --> 00:02:08,226
Does she even deserve that?

22
00:02:09,557 --> 00:02:12,607
I want to watch her body get torn to pieces.

23
00:02:18,573 --> 00:02:20,920
Only that will quench the hatred in my heart.

24
00:02:21,165 --> 00:02:22,402
Shen Xiao.

25
00:02:24,764 --> 00:02:26,680
Whether to the heavens or the underworld,

26
00:02:28,068 --> 00:02:29,880
I'll be with you.

27
00:02:54,692 --> 00:02:56,240
I'm not done having fun yet.

28
00:03:00,333 --> 00:03:02,772
Princess Zhao Yang and Censor Shen fell off the cliff by accident.

29
00:03:02,796 --> 00:03:04,942
Whatever happened today, keep it to yourself.

30
00:03:05,023 --> 00:03:06,260
Yes.

31
00:03:10,412 --> 00:03:13,186
The smartest thing Father ever did these past years

32
00:03:14,085 --> 00:03:17,268
was marrying the Crown Princess, my capable helper, to me.

33
00:03:17,789 --> 00:03:19,869
Not only did you see through Zhao Yang's disloyalty,

34
00:03:19,948 --> 00:03:23,483
you also took care of Shen Xiao, my biggest headache.

35
00:03:25,253 --> 00:03:26,493
The Eastern Palace's dignity

36
00:03:26,574 --> 00:03:28,000
is my own dignity.

37
00:03:28,214 --> 00:03:30,214
Anyone who stands in the way of the Eastern Palace

38
00:03:30,372 --> 00:03:31,609
won't be spared.

39
00:03:33,445 --> 00:03:35,605
When the day comes that the throne is finally secured,

40
00:03:41,052 --> 00:03:42,666
I shall share

41
00:03:43,252 --> 00:03:44,489
the vast kingdom

42
00:03:46,412 --> 00:03:47,746
with you.

43
00:03:50,967 --> 00:03:53,881
(Princess Zhao Yang Residence)

44
00:04:16,332 --> 00:04:17,569
(Zhao Yang.)

45
00:04:18,413 --> 00:04:20,026
(I've done so much for you.)

46
00:04:21,485 --> 00:04:22,722
(This time, )

47
00:04:23,588 --> 00:04:25,642
(you will finally see my true heart, won't you?)

48
00:04:35,133 --> 00:04:36,760
Prince Consort, please return.

49
00:04:38,997 --> 00:04:40,731
Can't you see who I am?

50
00:04:40,851 --> 00:04:41,891
Move aside.

51
00:04:42,036 --> 00:04:43,195
Forgive me, Prince Consort.

52
00:04:43,348 --> 00:04:44,672
Her Highness has left for Qianfo Temple.

53
00:04:44,696 --> 00:04:46,252
Before Her Highness left, she explicitly ordered that

54
00:04:46,276 --> 00:04:47,916
no one is allowed to enter the residence,

55
00:04:48,021 --> 00:04:49,314
including you, Prince Consort.

56
00:04:50,404 --> 00:04:51,641
Prince Consort.

57
00:04:55,028 --> 00:04:56,664
Gather everyone and search the mountain!

58
00:04:56,738 --> 00:04:58,458
- Quick! - The elders strictly forbade...

59
00:04:58,490 --> 00:05:01,000
- Go, now! - Yes, I'll obey.

60
00:05:06,364 --> 00:05:08,000
Your Highness!

61
00:05:08,081 --> 00:05:09,855
Princess and Censor Shen are in danger!

62
00:05:12,493 --> 00:05:13,840
Xiao Que.

63
00:05:14,716 --> 00:05:16,252
- Xiao Que. - Jian Xin?

64
00:05:17,918 --> 00:05:20,760
Your Highness, hurry and save the Princess.

65
00:06:06,493 --> 00:06:07,730
Shen Xiao.

66
00:06:08,236 --> 00:06:09,473
Shen Xiao.

67
00:06:15,980 --> 00:06:17,217
That's great.

68
00:06:18,125 --> 00:06:19,480
I made the right gamble.

69
00:06:19,716 --> 00:06:21,160
You're asking for death.

70
00:06:22,268 --> 00:06:24,668
(The bottom of this cliff is covered in vines and creepers.)

71
00:06:24,876 --> 00:06:26,440
(Instead of just waiting to die, )

72
00:06:26,763 --> 00:06:28,000
(why not...)

73
00:06:28,621 --> 00:06:29,858
Shen Xiao.

74
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:32,580
Whether to the heavens or the underworld,

75
00:06:33,132 --> 00:06:34,647
I'll be with you.

76
00:06:35,981 --> 00:06:37,218
(Let's take a chance.)

77
00:06:37,372 --> 00:06:39,252
(Maybe there's still a slim chance to survive.)

78
00:06:54,572 --> 00:06:56,026
(You look skinny, )

79
00:06:56,565 --> 00:06:58,200
(but you're actually pretty heavy.)

80
00:07:10,141 --> 00:07:11,378
(Shen Xiao.)

81
00:07:11,821 --> 00:07:13,520
(Hang in there a little longer.)

82
00:07:13,772 --> 00:07:15,267
(We're almost there.)

83
00:07:39,342 --> 00:07:40,960
(You're such a fool.)

84
00:07:41,933 --> 00:07:44,106
(Why would you take an arrow for me?)

85
00:07:45,868 --> 00:07:47,842
(You heard everything.)

86
00:07:48,533 --> 00:07:50,656
(Your father's death was because of me.)

87
00:07:51,636 --> 00:07:53,089
(Why would you...)

88
00:08:07,594 --> 00:08:08,831
You're awake.

89
00:08:12,429 --> 00:08:13,666
You're alright now.

90
00:08:15,165 --> 00:08:16,402
(Do you know)

91
00:08:16,956 --> 00:08:19,280
(what kind of person Zhao Yang really is?)

92
00:08:21,372 --> 00:08:23,160
(She played a huge part)

93
00:08:23,433 --> 00:08:26,514
in your father's death.

94
00:08:40,149 --> 00:08:42,040
You shouldn't have taken that arrow for me.

95
00:08:44,052 --> 00:08:45,289
What are you trying to say?

96
00:08:47,188 --> 00:08:48,922
Didn't you hear it all?

97
00:08:50,813 --> 00:08:52,640
Everything the Crown Prince said was true.

98
00:08:54,461 --> 00:08:55,816
(It was me.)

99
00:08:56,397 --> 00:08:59,586
(I handed the Crown Prince's evidence of wrongdoing over to your father.)

100
00:09:00,044 --> 00:09:01,898
(That's what led to his death.)

101
00:09:03,708 --> 00:09:06,122
I've always known the truth about your father's death.

102
00:09:08,582 --> 00:09:10,195
But I never told you.

103
00:09:19,046 --> 00:09:20,283
So...

104
00:09:21,372 --> 00:09:23,582
Were you afraid I'd hate you or blame you?

105
00:09:24,748 --> 00:09:26,683
Don't you hate me or blame me?

106
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:32,355
You have every right to hate me.

107
00:09:33,331 --> 00:09:34,666
But Shen Xiao,

108
00:09:34,789 --> 00:09:36,440
your father's death

109
00:09:37,693 --> 00:09:39,346
wasn't my fault.

110
00:09:50,933 --> 00:09:52,170
I know.

111
00:09:55,132 --> 00:09:56,640
My father's death

112
00:09:58,533 --> 00:10:00,906
was because of corrupt, greedy noble families,

113
00:10:02,637 --> 00:10:04,217
because of the Crown Prince who murdered to silence him

114
00:10:04,241 --> 00:10:06,120
in defiance of the law,

115
00:10:07,574 --> 00:10:08,800
and even more because of

116
00:10:08,892 --> 00:10:11,360
this world where people confound right and wrong.

117
00:10:11,724 --> 00:10:13,298
None of this is your fault.

118
00:10:25,391 --> 00:10:26,844
My father spent his whole life

119
00:10:27,428 --> 00:10:29,261
chasing after justice.

120
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:32,844
From the moment he got hold of that evidence,

121
00:10:33,915 --> 00:10:36,010
he knew the road ahead was perilous.

122
00:10:37,885 --> 00:10:39,122
Go get some rest.

123
00:10:40,988 --> 00:10:42,643
But that was his choice.

124
00:10:45,964 --> 00:10:47,379
Letting you use me

125
00:10:51,029 --> 00:10:52,483
was my own choice.

126
00:10:57,517 --> 00:10:59,651
I took that arrow for no other reason

127
00:11:01,822 --> 00:11:03,676
than that I didn't want you to get hurt.

128
00:11:04,646 --> 00:11:06,339
I never want that, not ever.

129
00:11:52,869 --> 00:11:54,400
(It's raining.)

130
00:12:00,069 --> 00:12:01,629
(The drought is over.)

131
00:12:01,774 --> 00:12:03,429
(Everything will pass.)

132
00:12:16,789 --> 00:12:18,120
Censor Shen!

133
00:12:18,259 --> 00:12:19,700
- Princess! - Sister!

134
00:12:19,813 --> 00:12:21,444
- Censor Shen! - Princess!

135
00:12:21,525 --> 00:12:22,650
- Sister! - Censor Shen!

136
00:12:22,731 --> 00:12:24,200
Princess!

137
00:12:24,301 --> 00:12:25,461
Sister!

138
00:12:25,573 --> 00:12:26,613
Censor Shen!

139
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:27,937
Princess!

140
00:12:28,972 --> 00:12:30,010
Sister!

141
00:12:30,107 --> 00:12:31,932
Censor Shen!

142
00:12:32,027 --> 00:12:33,400
Princess!

143
00:12:33,525 --> 00:12:34,762
Censor Shen!

144
00:12:35,123 --> 00:12:36,397
Princess!

145
00:12:36,478 --> 00:12:38,460
- Censor Shen! - Sister!

146
00:12:38,541 --> 00:12:39,900
Princess!

147
00:12:40,019 --> 00:12:41,220
Censor Shen!

148
00:12:41,333 --> 00:12:43,080
- Princess! - Censor Shen!

149
00:12:43,204 --> 00:12:44,565
Princess!

150
00:12:44,645 --> 00:12:46,259
Censor Shen!

151
00:12:46,749 --> 00:12:48,228
Princess!

152
00:12:48,363 --> 00:12:50,977
Princess!

153
00:12:51,230 --> 00:12:52,310
Princess!

154
00:12:52,429 --> 00:12:53,922
Zhao Yang!

155
00:12:54,621 --> 00:12:56,100
Princess!

156
00:12:56,188 --> 00:12:57,763
Princess!

157
00:12:58,629 --> 00:13:00,269
Princess!

158
00:13:00,413 --> 00:13:01,624
Princess!

159
00:13:01,719 --> 00:13:03,320
Princess!

160
00:13:03,477 --> 00:13:04,814
I'll head this way.

161
00:13:04,901 --> 00:13:06,269
- You guys go over there. - Yes.

162
00:13:06,422 --> 00:13:07,426
Yes.

163
00:13:07,573 --> 00:13:09,003
Princess!

164
00:13:09,108 --> 00:13:11,673
Princess!

165
00:13:12,828 --> 00:13:15,059
Princess!

166
00:13:15,213 --> 00:13:16,364
Princess!

167
00:13:16,493 --> 00:13:19,746
Zhao Yang!

168
00:13:20,212 --> 00:13:21,732
Princess!

169
00:13:21,868 --> 00:13:23,923
Nothing over here. Go check over there.

170
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:25,915
Zhao Yang!

171
00:13:26,653 --> 00:13:28,906
Princess!

172
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:37,520
Actually, my childhood name

173
00:13:37,669 --> 00:13:39,000
was Que Nu.

174
00:13:40,724 --> 00:13:41,961
Que Nu?

175
00:13:42,709 --> 00:13:43,946
Xiao Que.

176
00:13:46,204 --> 00:13:47,724
It's not just the name that's similar.

177
00:13:48,572 --> 00:13:50,480
Her fierce will to survive

178
00:13:50,742 --> 00:13:52,716
at all costs is similar too.

179
00:13:55,343 --> 00:13:58,040
A hard life leaves scars on a person.

180
00:14:00,915 --> 00:14:03,850
If Xiao Que hadn't been so terrified of starving,

181
00:14:04,741 --> 00:14:06,240
she wouldn't have died.

182
00:14:06,668 --> 00:14:07,905
All these years,

183
00:14:09,437 --> 00:14:11,891
I climbed my way up to become Princess Zhao Yang,

184
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,394
hoping that one day

185
00:14:15,437 --> 00:14:17,080
I wouldn't have to fight,

186
00:14:17,461 --> 00:14:19,000
wouldn't have to scheme,

187
00:14:19,141 --> 00:14:21,560
wouldn't have to live in constant fear

188
00:14:22,197 --> 00:14:24,280
of being at someone else's mercy.

189
00:14:28,780 --> 00:14:30,680
When my mother was really sick,

190
00:14:31,884 --> 00:14:34,080
we traded everything we had for medicine.

191
00:14:34,349 --> 00:14:36,083
All that was left was a single hairpin.

192
00:14:38,214 --> 00:14:41,280
So, that hairpin you always wear in your hair

193
00:14:41,788 --> 00:14:43,482
was left to you by your mother.

194
00:15:01,565 --> 00:15:03,520
Where did my wooden hairpin go?

195
00:15:03,847 --> 00:15:05,760
It probably fell down the cliff.

196
00:15:05,885 --> 00:15:07,360
Sit still.

197
00:15:08,428 --> 00:15:10,080
That was a keepsake from your mother.

198
00:15:10,365 --> 00:15:11,605
You're hurt so badly right now.

199
00:15:11,654 --> 00:15:12,712
It's pouring rain outside.

200
00:15:12,793 --> 00:15:14,366
What if you die out there?

201
00:15:18,781 --> 00:15:21,194
So, I do matter to Your Highness after all.

202
00:15:25,230 --> 00:15:26,804
It's just a wooden hairpin.

203
00:15:27,390 --> 00:15:28,844
If it's lost, it's lost.

204
00:15:35,285 --> 00:15:36,859
Until everything settles down,

205
00:15:39,445 --> 00:15:41,640
your life matters more than anything else.

206
00:15:49,077 --> 00:15:50,680
Then let me ask you,

207
00:15:51,956 --> 00:15:53,840
can I ever have a proper title?

208
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:14,568
(Your Highness.)

209
00:16:15,268 --> 00:16:18,120
(We'll definitely live the best life possible.)

210
00:16:32,349 --> 00:16:33,800
Your Highness, please take a look.

211
00:16:38,613 --> 00:16:40,120
Does it look neat enough?

212
00:16:45,939 --> 00:16:48,059
The Top Scholar's handwriting is naturally flawless.

213
00:16:48,252 --> 00:16:50,560
But good fortune written on paper is just empty words.

214
00:16:50,693 --> 00:16:52,710
You might as well stuff more gold ingots in the dumplings.

215
00:16:52,734 --> 00:16:54,440
That's way more practical.

216
00:17:15,613 --> 00:17:17,027
Is this practical?

217
00:17:24,277 --> 00:17:25,514
Princess.

218
00:17:25,798 --> 00:17:28,360
I wrote so many words today.

219
00:17:28,595 --> 00:17:30,440
- Xiao Que. - Princess.

220
00:17:31,517 --> 00:17:32,891
Princess.

221
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:34,380
I missed you so much.

222
00:17:34,571 --> 00:17:35,756
What have you been sneaking off to eat again?

223
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,035
Your cheeks are all puffed up.

224
00:17:37,212 --> 00:17:38,493
As Your Highness said,

225
00:17:38,653 --> 00:17:40,309
you need a full stomach to have the energy

226
00:17:40,333 --> 00:17:41,773
to enjoy life.

227
00:17:41,909 --> 00:17:43,320
Such a good kid.

228
00:17:44,669 --> 00:17:46,323
Why are you so late?

229
00:17:46,468 --> 00:17:48,388
You don't need to work for me on New Year's Eve?

230
00:17:48,685 --> 00:17:50,884
My head is spinning from all those memorials.

231
00:17:51,012 --> 00:17:52,475
I still have over 10 pounds of scrolls

232
00:17:52,499 --> 00:17:53,823
waiting for my review.

233
00:17:54,309 --> 00:17:55,546
That's great.

234
00:17:55,650 --> 00:17:56,907
The busier you are, the more free time I get.

235
00:17:56,931 --> 00:17:58,168
Let's go.

236
00:18:06,493 --> 00:18:08,347
So beautiful.

237
00:18:49,612 --> 00:18:50,849
Zhao Yang.

238
00:18:53,069 --> 00:18:54,520
I'm so glad you're alright.

239
00:18:54,861 --> 00:18:56,098
That's all that matters.

240
00:18:56,733 --> 00:18:58,493
- Let go of me. - That's all that matters.

241
00:18:58,543 --> 00:19:00,303
- That's all that matters. - Let go of me.

242
00:19:10,686 --> 00:19:11,923
Shen Xiao?

243
00:19:12,733 --> 00:19:13,970
What are you doing here?

244
00:19:18,077 --> 00:19:19,771
I should be asking you that.

245
00:19:20,396 --> 00:19:22,396
Yesterday, we were ambushed by the Eastern Palace,

246
00:19:22,476 --> 00:19:24,196
and today you just happen to track us down.

247
00:19:24,302 --> 00:19:25,782
Did you come to verify if we're dead,

248
00:19:25,839 --> 00:19:27,120
or to finish the job?

249
00:19:27,208 --> 00:19:28,445
You're hurt?

250
00:19:28,893 --> 00:19:30,849
- I'll take you back. - You can't take her.

251
00:19:33,782 --> 00:19:35,556
She's my wife.

252
00:19:35,821 --> 00:19:37,475
Of course I can take her with me.

253
00:19:37,867 --> 00:19:39,428
She's safe with me.

254
00:19:39,599 --> 00:19:40,599
Is that so?

255
00:19:40,885 --> 00:19:41,924
Then yesterday,

256
00:19:42,005 --> 00:19:44,260
where were you when the Princess was in danger?

257
00:20:14,381 --> 00:20:16,196
Censor Shen, your injuries are serious.

258
00:20:20,797 --> 00:20:22,920
Don't worry about anything else for now.

259
00:21:19,252 --> 00:21:22,400
(Princess Zhao Yang Residence)

260
00:21:37,416 --> 00:21:38,635
It's not hot anymore.

261
00:21:38,733 --> 00:21:39,970
Get out.

262
00:21:40,885 --> 00:21:42,122
Que Nu.

263
00:21:42,508 --> 00:21:44,525
Take the medicine, and I'll leave after that.

264
00:21:47,104 --> 00:21:48,498
You don't need to do any of this.

265
00:21:49,003 --> 00:21:51,720
You handed me the divorce letter yourself on our wedding night.

266
00:21:53,012 --> 00:21:54,972
We ceased being husband and wife a long time ago.

267
00:22:02,141 --> 00:22:03,341
All these years,

268
00:22:03,461 --> 00:22:05,000
you've been resenting me, haven't you?

269
00:22:05,277 --> 00:22:06,572
You knew that day,

270
00:22:06,668 --> 00:22:08,442
everything I said was just out of anger.

271
00:22:08,572 --> 00:22:10,892
Haven't I been trying to make it up to you all this while?

272
00:22:12,125 --> 00:22:14,600
Why can't you just let it go?

273
00:22:20,644 --> 00:22:21,881
What is that?

274
00:22:28,582 --> 00:22:29,819
It's none of your business.

275
00:22:30,973 --> 00:22:32,480
It's from Shen Xiao.

276
00:22:37,331 --> 00:22:38,920
What are you doing? Let go!

277
00:22:39,269 --> 00:22:40,600
Cui Jin Zhi, let go!

278
00:22:40,709 --> 00:22:41,946
Give it to me!

279
00:22:46,132 --> 00:22:47,705
This belongs to the Eastern Palace.

280
00:22:56,093 --> 00:22:57,330
Don't tell me

281
00:22:58,148 --> 00:22:59,803
you're planning to use this

282
00:23:00,149 --> 00:23:02,643
to prove the Crown Prince tried to murder his own kin.

283
00:23:03,228 --> 00:23:04,465
Are you crazy?

284
00:23:07,252 --> 00:23:08,880
If I don't bring down the Crown Prince,

285
00:23:09,709 --> 00:23:11,349
I'll end up dead at his hands someday.

286
00:23:11,508 --> 00:23:12,745
No, you won't.

287
00:23:14,285 --> 00:23:15,480
From now on,

288
00:23:15,612 --> 00:23:17,400
I won't let anyone hurt you.

289
00:23:18,308 --> 00:23:20,400
The justice you want, I'll give it to you.

290
00:23:20,916 --> 00:23:22,930
But not by going about it this way.

291
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:31,443
Seeking justice?

292
00:23:32,742 --> 00:23:34,560
If I had really died yesterday,

293
00:23:36,733 --> 00:23:38,960
would you have killed the Crown Prince to avenge me?

294
00:23:59,780 --> 00:24:01,017
Give it to me.

295
00:24:30,515 --> 00:24:32,680
- No! - Zhao Yang.

296
00:24:37,061 --> 00:24:38,140
I know.

297
00:24:38,221 --> 00:24:39,421
I know you hate me.

298
00:24:39,502 --> 00:24:40,919
You hate how I let you down back then.

299
00:24:40,943 --> 00:24:42,783
You hate how I've ignored you all these years.

300
00:24:42,972 --> 00:24:44,800
You hate that I was with someone else.

301
00:24:45,012 --> 00:24:46,525
But when I heard you fell off the cliff,

302
00:24:46,549 --> 00:24:49,280
that's when I realized, Zhao Yang, I can't lose you.

303
00:24:50,334 --> 00:24:51,800
Let's wipe the slate clean

304
00:24:52,653 --> 00:24:54,187
on everything that's passed.

305
00:24:55,092 --> 00:24:56,986
Can we go back to how we used to be?

306
00:24:58,012 --> 00:25:00,066
Please?

307
00:25:02,324 --> 00:25:04,680
- Zhao Yang. - I don't want that!

308
00:25:04,793 --> 00:25:06,920
All these years, to please the Crown Prince,

309
00:25:07,247 --> 00:25:09,007
you kept using me as a pawn again and again.

310
00:25:09,547 --> 00:25:11,695
And now you want to just wipe it all clean?

311
00:25:11,861 --> 00:25:13,200
In your dreams.

312
00:25:13,526 --> 00:25:15,000
Cui Jin Zhi.

313
00:25:15,653 --> 00:25:17,600
You really disgust me!

314
00:25:28,563 --> 00:25:29,800
Disgust?

315
00:25:30,476 --> 00:25:32,170
Wasn't this your choice?

316
00:25:32,796 --> 00:25:34,374
You used me, then used the Crown Prince,

317
00:25:34,398 --> 00:25:35,589
just to get out of the Cold Palace.

318
00:25:35,613 --> 00:25:37,187
You think I don't know anything?

319
00:25:38,124 --> 00:25:39,497
Let me tell you,

320
00:25:40,500 --> 00:25:42,315
we're the same kind of people.

321
00:25:43,453 --> 00:25:44,986
We use each other.

322
00:25:45,132 --> 00:25:46,705
We scheme against each other.

323
00:25:48,788 --> 00:25:50,883
We're meant to stay together forever,

324
00:25:51,068 --> 00:25:52,629
tangled up till the very end,

325
00:25:52,766 --> 00:25:54,339
till death do us part.

326
00:26:01,141 --> 00:26:04,713
Crown Prince is the heir the noble families jointly backed.

327
00:26:05,272 --> 00:26:08,210
He's also my only hope to restore my family's honor.

328
00:26:08,540 --> 00:26:10,040
You want to go after him?

329
00:26:10,493 --> 00:26:11,746
That's never going to happen.

330
00:26:25,715 --> 00:26:27,090
Just focus on getting better.

331
00:26:38,493 --> 00:26:39,730
Starting today,

332
00:26:39,940 --> 00:26:41,877
replace all guards inside and outside the residence.

333
00:26:41,901 --> 00:26:43,741
Without my order, no one is allowed in or out.

334
00:26:43,893 --> 00:26:45,130
Yes.

335
00:26:51,091 --> 00:26:53,160
(Princess Zhao Yang Residence)

336
00:26:54,254 --> 00:26:55,491
(Zhao Yang.)

337
00:26:57,628 --> 00:26:59,602
(I promise I'll get you out of here.)
